  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UPCN - UNIAO PROVINCIAL DOS CAMPONESES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program will promote agricultural production, productivity and resilient through supporting the access to extension service, land, technology and market, particularly for women and youth  promoting. The Programme will strengthen Sustainable Natural Resource Management through embedding the principles of sustainable resource use into its training on sustainable agricultural production and its climate smart agricultural practices. The programme will also build on Oxfam&#x2019;s proven, gender-transformative, and Farmer Field School-based approaches to participatory plant breeding, community-based seed production, climate smart agricultural production and nutrition  to increase crop and varietal diversity; improve agroecological cropping methods to boost production and adapt to climate change</narrative>
  </description>
