  </participating-org>
  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Niassa Provincial Farmers Union was founded in 2008 on the initiative of the province&apos;s farmers. It aims to contribute in the areas of Agriculture and Agribusiness, Advocacy, Natural Resources and Biodiversity and Gender and Development. In this programme, the UPCN will lead activities to promote and increase production and productivity in order to guarantee food security and improve family incomes.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uni&#xe3;o Provincial de Camponeses do N</narrative>
